  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "The sun is big and yellow today. Dad and Lily are in the kitchen. It is lunch. Lily has a big smile. Dad says, \"Let's sing a lunch song!\" \"Yes, Dad!\" says Lily. Pip sits next to the table. He looks at the eggs. He wants one.",
      "\"Rice, rice, white and good!\" \"Egg, egg, one, two, three!\" \"Lime, lime, green and small!\" \"Water, water, for you and me!\" \"Sun, sun, it is lunch!\" Lily counts the eggs with her hand. Dad puts a small lime on the table. Dad sings and Lily claps. They sing the song again.",
      "\"Woof!\" says Pip. \"Is it lunch for Pip too?\" asks Lily. \"Yes,\" says Dad. \"Pip has one egg.\" Pip eats his egg. Dad and Lily eat rice and eggs. They drink water with lime. The sun comes in the window. Lily says, \"Good lunch, Dad!\" Dad smiles. It is a happy lunch!"
    ],
    "summary": "Dad and Lily sing a lunch song in the kitchen on a sunny day. They make rice and eggs, and Pip waits for his egg.",
